  "details": "In the Avatar tab of the Main Menu, the Change Avatar button sometimes does not work by pressing it once.\n\nThe message \"Avatar changed to...\" is printed, and the sound effect for the button plays,  but the avatar is not changed. If I press the button multiple times, the avatar will certainly change. This issue often occurs if the menu is closed too quickly after pressing the button, but I am not sure of the exact cause.\n\nThis issue has been present for several months.",
